          "text": " Kotema Musa Edeke ebe, “Koany, naadolokinio eoŋoŋ idwe luka Isirael, kalimokin kes ebe, ‘Edeke loka lukapapaakus ŋes keyakunit mama ijaas yesi’; kes da keŋisete eoŋ ebe, ‘Ekekiror iŋai?’ alimokini kes biai?” ",
