        },
        {
          "text": " Kobala Edeke Musa ebe, “Ilimokini idwe luka Isirael ebe, ‘EJAKAIT, Edeke loka lukapapaakus, Edeke loka Aburaam, Edeke loka Isaak, Edeke loka Yakob da, ŋes keyakunit mamakus’: ŋol ŋes ekakiror ikar kere, ŋin da ŋes aiituneteka anatar aturio kere. ",
