              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " Iirarete ekoniporoto: ibuni ijo ka imakio luka Isirael, mama ejai ekabaka loka Misiri ilimokinete ebe, ‘Abu EJAKAIT, Edeke loka Iburanian keriamunos kasio; asa keŋaiŋait, kisiikinai kaloto alosit naka apaarasia auni toma amodiŋ; ainakin asuban neejai EJAKAIT Ekosideke.’ ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.3.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.3.18"
            ]
          }
        },
